  'qnfo-audit 2026-10-26T10:52Z (SELECT only): the doctor migration is applied (migration_runs id 606 ok at 10:22:09Z), ops_config breach_doctor = on, breach_diagnosis_events exists with 3 tick events (newest 10:50:49Z), metric_registry doctor_tick_age_min is MEASURED (last_value 10, last_refreshed 10:50:49Z, written by the doctor itself), spof_registry holds the doctor row with a planned: alternate_path and issue_id 1000397, control_registry breach-doctor-switch exists, agent_issues 1000397 is open with a contract on job-run events, and no cloud_ops_events row of kind breach-doctor-watch exists; the job ran in qnfo-cloud-ops/breach-doctor-watch.test.mjs on node:sqlite over fixtures with the live column lists, the live unique open-title index and the live birth-contract and refile-reopen triggers of agent_issues',
  'migration applied by CI at merge, the qnfo-cloud-ops 1.39.0 deploy is pending (it runs after the migration, with its canary): proof to read later is a cloud_ops_events row id breach-doctor-watch-tick of kind breach-doctor-watch whose meta carries version 1.39.0 and is under 30 minutes old, and a chaos drill pass that stamps spof_registry alternate_tested_at for the doctor tick row; the acting half stays open as issue BREACH-DOCTOR-WATCH-1',
  'one spof_registry row, one spof_alternate_probes row, one failure mode with its detector contract and one capability row; the job writes metric_registry doctor_tick_age_min and cloud_ops_events and, on a stall and at most once in 120 minutes, one agent_issues row with its remediation contract; it reads breach_diagnosis_events and writes nothing while that table is missing or ops_config breach_doctor is off',
  'the Rollback header of migrations/2026-10-26-breach-doctor-watch.sql; the worker change reverts with the canonical deploy canary',
  'a stalled breach doctor is measured and reported by a second worker without a session',
  'within 20 minutes of the qnfo-cloud-ops 1.39.0 deploy: a cloud_ops_events row of kind breach-doctor-watch is under 30 minutes old and metric doctor_tick_age_min is refreshed by qnfo-cloud-ops (the ledger and the doctor are live already)',
